WEBVTT

01:28.825 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL
"MY QUEEN" BY XIE LOUNAN

01:37.545 --> 01:39.505
General. The darn emperor's
reinforcements have arrived.

01:44.945 --> 01:47.665
JIANGZHOU

01:49.505 --> 01:50.745
Retreat ten li!

01:51.585 --> 01:53.025
Retreat ten li!

02:03.545 --> 02:04.545
Jueding.

02:05.185 --> 02:06.705
Jueding. How is it?

02:07.385 --> 02:08.545
-Leave.
-Yes.

02:10.584 --> 02:11.425
Is it serious?

02:12.265 --> 02:13.105
You're being reckless.

02:13.185 --> 02:15.785
As the empress,
you should stay in the palace.

02:15.865 --> 02:17.065
How can you come to such a place?

02:17.585 --> 02:18.505
How dare you mention that?

02:19.465 --> 02:21.025
I heard the situation
in Jiangzhou is critical.

02:21.105 --> 02:22.105
Do you know how worried I am about you?

02:22.705 --> 02:24.425
Regarding your arrival in Jiangzhou today,

02:24.505 --> 02:26.585
did Father and His Majesty know?
Could they rest assured?

02:28.665 --> 02:30.665
I didn't tell Father.
As for the other one,

02:31.585 --> 02:32.425
it's better not to tell him.

02:36.985 --> 02:38.065
Did he bully you?

02:45.545 --> 02:47.625
His Majesty has always been calculating.

02:47.705 --> 02:48.865
I know

02:48.945 --> 02:50.945
he wants to use
you to achieve direct rule.

02:51.465 --> 02:52.865
He doesn't care about your safety at all.

02:55.545 --> 02:56.865
None of that matters now.

02:56.945 --> 02:57.985
Sit.

03:00.985 --> 03:04.185
What matters
is I can now confirm you're safe.

03:04.265 --> 03:06.705
Otherwise, how could I rest easy
staying in the palace?

03:07.305 --> 03:08.385
Cangcang.

03:08.465 --> 03:10.345
I know you want to
roam the martial world alone,

03:10.425 --> 03:11.265
being free and carefree.

03:12.505 --> 03:15.505
If it weren't for the Ling family
or for Father,

03:16.025 --> 03:17.385
how would you have
been coerced by Xiao Huan?

03:18.345 --> 03:19.865
When I learned you were to marry him,

03:19.945 --> 03:20.905
I thought about returning to the Capital,

03:20.985 --> 03:22.985
but that Xiao Huan wouldn't let me.

03:23.985 --> 03:26.425
Orders are orders.
Without imperial decree, I cannot return.

03:26.505 --> 03:28.185
But if I had known
today would turn out like this,

03:28.265 --> 03:30.585
I would have risked my life
to bring you out of that cage.

03:32.065 --> 03:33.745
Jueding has really grown up.

03:33.825 --> 03:35.025
You even worry about me now.

03:39.185 --> 03:40.785
But what you just said

03:41.345 --> 03:43.945
is beyond our control.
No need to blame yourself.

03:45.705 --> 03:46.745
Very well.

03:46.825 --> 03:48.585
Since you've come to Jiangzhou,

03:48.665 --> 03:50.265
stay safely in the camp.

03:50.345 --> 03:51.185
Don't run around.

03:51.265 --> 03:53.305
I'll send someone to escort you back soon.

03:53.385 --> 03:54.425
I won't go back.

03:55.425 --> 03:57.145
Do you even remember who you are?

03:57.225 --> 03:59.025
-I…
-Jiangzhou's situation is grim.

03:59.105 --> 04:02.345
If anything happens to you,
how could I explain to Father?

04:02.425 --> 04:03.945
You rushed to
the battlefield to save me earlier.

04:04.025 --> 04:05.745
Just as reckless as before.

04:06.465 --> 04:07.425
But if something happens,

04:07.505 --> 04:09.225
-how am I supposed to handle it?
-Jueding.

04:12.145 --> 04:15.145
I'm
no longer a weak woman needing protection.

04:15.225 --> 04:16.504
Although I'm not
an expert in military strategy,

04:16.585 --> 04:17.425
I know a bit.

04:17.504 --> 04:18.865
Jiangzhou's situation is dire.

04:18.944 --> 04:19.944
You urgently need manpower.

04:20.025 --> 04:21.184
-I must stay and help you.
-But…

04:21.265 --> 04:22.545
No discussion.

04:28.465 --> 04:29.585
Jiangzhou is dangerous.

04:29.665 --> 04:31.545
But fortunately, reinforcements are here.

04:31.625 --> 04:32.825
They can temporarily
hold back Kumor's army.

04:33.745 --> 04:35.825
I've analyzed Kumor's army's
positions and terrain

04:35.905 --> 04:37.065
and have some speculations.

04:43.105 --> 04:44.945
Your Majesty. Victory at Jiangzhou.

04:47.545 --> 04:48.705
Reinforcements have reached Jiangzhou.

04:48.785 --> 04:50.185
Kumor's forces have retreated ten li.

04:51.465 --> 04:52.745
Xiaoxing Guards
reported back with intelligence.

04:52.825 --> 04:54.625
Kumor is assembling his troops,
planning a counterattack.

04:54.705 --> 04:57.385
He's always ruthless and cold-blooded.

04:57.465 --> 04:59.585
But my collected intelligence

04:59.665 --> 05:01.065
regarding his personal habits is limited.

05:03.545 --> 05:04.745
It seems

05:05.385 --> 05:07.825
my plans must be advanced.

05:17.065 --> 05:20.945
JIANGZHOU

05:29.025 --> 05:30.225
Sir.

05:33.185 --> 05:34.785
What is it? Speak.

05:35.825 --> 05:37.945
Sir. I've received news

05:38.025 --> 05:40.345
Young Lady has arrived in
Jiangzhou with the westbound army.

05:40.425 --> 05:42.305
Currently, she is in General Ling's camp.

05:48.625 --> 05:50.585
Her Majesty has traveled west,

05:51.745 --> 05:54.265
yet I had no knowledge of it.

05:56.585 --> 05:57.585
I deserve punishment.

05:58.385 --> 06:00.665
Sir. The palace publicly claims

06:00.745 --> 06:01.785
that Her Majesty is
recuperating at the outer palace,

06:01.865 --> 06:04.745
but Li Hongqing has
sealed it off completely.

06:04.825 --> 06:07.265
My men can't gather any information.

06:07.345 --> 06:10.305
Nor did we know Young Lady is
with the westbound reinforcements.

06:10.385 --> 06:11.585
Please punish me.

06:13.425 --> 06:14.305
You may leave.

06:14.945 --> 06:16.425
Yes. Thank you.

06:30.625 --> 06:31.745
Stay calm.

06:31.825 --> 06:34.265
General Ling has already
gathered supplies for everyone,

06:34.345 --> 06:37.305
ensuring that every
citizen in Jiangzhou receives food.

06:37.385 --> 06:41.545
-Good!
-Good!

06:44.025 --> 06:46.105
Line up. Everyone will get a share.

06:46.705 --> 06:48.225
-Thank you.
-Don't rush. Everyone will get a share.

06:48.305 --> 06:49.145
Thank you.

06:50.265 --> 06:51.985
It's the year of famine.

06:52.065 --> 06:53.185
Food is scarce everywhere.

06:53.785 --> 06:56.825
You distribute food to
the people of Jiangzhou.

06:57.425 --> 06:58.825
You're indeed
an excellent general of Great Qi.

06:59.745 --> 07:01.625
Cangcang. Stop praising me.

07:01.705 --> 07:02.625
-Let's hand out the food together.
-Line up.

07:03.905 --> 07:04.825
Alright.

07:08.345 --> 07:09.465
QI

07:09.545 --> 07:10.905
The westbound reinforcements' supplies

07:10.985 --> 07:13.185
can only temporarily
ease Jiangzhou's crisis.

07:13.265 --> 07:15.265
The imperial grain shipments

07:15.345 --> 07:17.505
will take at least another half month.

07:17.585 --> 07:20.105
So, we need to consider other solutions.

07:20.185 --> 07:22.665
With the Xijiang snow disaster,
Kumor is also short of supplies.

07:23.985 --> 07:25.305
If Kumor runs out of supplies,

07:26.465 --> 07:27.305
will he have to retreat?

07:28.265 --> 07:29.105
What do you mean?

07:29.785 --> 07:30.905
During war,

07:30.985 --> 07:32.985
both armies will
always set up key supply points.

07:33.065 --> 07:35.185
We might as well make use of it
and kill two birds with one stone.

07:36.145 --> 07:37.305
Look.

07:37.825 --> 07:40.025
This is Jiangzhou City.
This is Kumor's camp.

07:40.105 --> 07:41.665
Kumor's Black Tiger Army

07:41.745 --> 07:44.425
charged toward
Jiangzhou City with unstoppable momentum.

07:44.505 --> 07:45.705
Smooth and unhindered.

07:46.505 --> 07:49.105
But to their east lies
dense forest and swamp.

07:49.785 --> 07:51.345
Behind them is Qianlai Valley.

07:51.425 --> 07:53.865
Qianlai Valley is
known for its bottleneck terrain.

07:54.465 --> 07:56.385
The mountains on both
sides aren't high, but they're steep.

07:56.465 --> 07:58.305
Kumor's tactics are cunning.

07:58.385 --> 07:59.345
They chose this terrain

07:59.425 --> 08:01.505
to prevent ambushes.

08:01.585 --> 08:03.385
And they can fall back and defend.

08:03.465 --> 08:05.785
But Qianlai Valley's
mountain paths are extremely difficult.

08:05.865 --> 08:09.025
It's not a suitable place for
storing or transporting military supplies.

08:09.105 --> 08:10.265
Moreover,

08:11.225 --> 08:12.905
the valley sits against
the mountains and by the water.

08:12.985 --> 08:14.145
Are you saying

08:14.225 --> 08:16.625
they traveled by water to Sand City,

08:16.705 --> 08:19.265
and Sand City is their key supply point?

08:20.585 --> 08:21.665
It's possible.

08:21.745 --> 08:23.745
If it's their vital point,
it'll be heavily guarded.

08:24.545 --> 08:26.305
Our army won't be
able to take it so easily.

08:26.385 --> 08:28.825
Our goal isn't to take over Sand City,

08:28.905 --> 08:30.345
but to seize their grain supplies.

08:31.385 --> 08:32.305
I can lead a night raid on Sand City.

08:32.385 --> 08:33.385
SAND CITY

08:33.465 --> 08:34.465
We'll catch them off guard.

08:35.225 --> 08:36.985
If we manage to seize the grain,

08:37.065 --> 08:39.784
not only will the people in the city
and the soldiers get a breather,

08:39.865 --> 08:42.305
but it may also help end the war quickly.

09:11.825 --> 09:13.265
You control the others.

09:13.345 --> 09:14.425
You come with me to find the main house.

09:14.505 --> 09:15.625
-Yes.
-Let's go.

09:35.985 --> 09:37.865
Spare me, Sir. Spare me.

09:44.865 --> 09:45.905
Fix your clothes.

09:48.945 --> 09:50.985
-You're kind-hearted.
-Cut the nonsense.

09:51.065 --> 09:53.745
Where is your commanding general?
Tell me, and I'll spare your life.

10:00.545 --> 10:01.505
I don't know.

10:02.105 --> 10:03.625
Kumor suffered a defeat.

10:03.705 --> 10:05.745
As soon as the sun
set, he took people away,

10:06.265 --> 10:09.105
saying they had important
military matters to discuss.

10:13.105 --> 10:13.945
And who are you?

10:14.825 --> 10:16.345
My name is Minmin.

10:16.425 --> 10:18.105
They abducted me.

10:18.185 --> 10:20.905
I… I don't know anything.

10:29.825 --> 10:30.945
How am I supposed to know

10:31.625 --> 10:33.145
you're not lying to me?

10:35.185 --> 10:37.505
They gave me these whip marks.

10:37.585 --> 10:39.785
I've been living in hell every day.

10:41.105 --> 10:42.305
Thank god you came.

10:42.905 --> 10:44.425
Take me with you.

10:45.185 --> 10:46.865
Commander. We're running out of time.

10:46.945 --> 10:48.345
If Black Tiger Army finds out
something is off with Sand City,

10:48.425 --> 10:50.665
forget transporting supplies,
we won't even get out alive.

10:51.705 --> 10:54.505
I know where this city's grain is stored,
but I have one condition.

10:54.585 --> 10:56.225
If you find the grain,

10:56.305 --> 10:57.905
you must take me with you.

11:07.345 --> 11:08.385
How is the situation?

11:09.185 --> 11:11.025
We've basically secured everyone here.

11:13.225 --> 11:15.225
Good. Leave a few men to watch them.

11:15.305 --> 11:17.105
-The rest, come with me.
-Yes.

11:26.665 --> 11:27.625
Sir.

11:28.705 --> 11:30.985
Can I at least have a sip of water?

11:53.425 --> 11:55.145
Your Highness. Are you alright?

11:57.065 --> 11:59.185
Do I look alright to you?
A bunch of useless fools.

12:00.945 --> 12:03.265
If I hadn't improvised on the spot
and fooled them,

12:03.785 --> 12:05.905
I, the commander of Sand City,

12:05.985 --> 12:07.945
would've become
the joke of Black Tiger Army.

12:08.025 --> 12:08.865
Yes.

12:09.465 --> 12:11.785
Your Highness. What should we do now?

12:13.985 --> 12:15.185
Go.

12:15.265 --> 12:16.785
Release the refugees we locked up.

12:17.785 --> 12:20.585
-Tell them they have food now.
-Yes.

12:35.745 --> 12:37.385
This grain was way too easy to get.

12:38.145 --> 12:39.865
Kumor suffered a defeat.

12:39.945 --> 12:42.185
As soon as the sun
set, he took people away,

12:42.265 --> 12:45.625
saying they had important
military matters to discuss.

12:46.385 --> 12:48.065
My name is Minmin.

12:48.145 --> 12:49.825
They abducted me.

12:49.905 --> 12:52.865
I… I don't know anything.

12:54.585 --> 12:56.745
I know where this city's grain is stored,

12:56.825 --> 12:58.185
but I have one condition.

12:59.625 --> 13:00.665
Something's off with that woman.

13:01.305 --> 13:02.545
All soldiers, listen up!

13:02.625 --> 13:04.545
Take the grain and evacuate immediately!

13:04.625 --> 13:05.945
Yes!

13:11.585 --> 13:12.425
Quick, keep up!

13:28.585 --> 13:29.745
Why can't we see
which direction the tracks go?

13:31.265 --> 13:33.345
Could it be they sensed it beforehand?

13:34.505 --> 13:35.545
Move.

13:43.745 --> 13:44.985
-Where's the grain?
-It's all gone.

13:45.065 --> 13:46.105
-What happened?
-How is everything gone?

13:46.185 --> 13:47.065
Yes.

13:48.625 --> 13:50.145
Looks like they already knew. Retreat.

14:00.705 --> 14:02.865
Sir. You scared me.

14:05.585 --> 14:07.625
We meet again. Sand City Lord.

14:11.145 --> 14:12.505
You're quite clever.

14:13.625 --> 14:14.945
May I ask where I slipped up?

14:15.545 --> 14:16.585
Your whip marks.

14:18.705 --> 14:20.385
I heard noise last night.

14:20.465 --> 14:22.145
Knowing I couldn't escape,

14:22.225 --> 14:23.825
I quickly whipped myself a few times.

14:23.905 --> 14:24.865
Just enough, not too heavy.

14:25.985 --> 14:28.025
And I usually use a long whip.

14:28.105 --> 14:29.785
So having old marks is unavoidable.

14:29.865 --> 14:31.065
Yes.

14:31.705 --> 14:34.825
At first, your mix of old and new marks
did fool me.

14:34.905 --> 14:35.825
After all,

14:36.425 --> 14:37.385
a woman as pretty as you

14:38.025 --> 14:39.305
is hard not to sympathize with.

14:39.945 --> 14:41.665
But you still held back too much.

14:41.745 --> 14:43.545
Some marks were too fresh.

14:43.625 --> 14:46.385
And your room
was decorated far too femininely.

14:46.985 --> 14:49.185
So you hid the direction of the tracks,

14:49.265 --> 14:50.585
keeping us from finding the grain.

14:51.985 --> 14:53.305
You think you can stall us?

14:53.385 --> 14:56.585
Ask my whip if it agrees.

15:25.905 --> 15:27.185
Don't come closer.

15:28.145 --> 15:29.345
One more step and I'll kill her.

15:39.025 --> 15:40.985
Stop him.
I'll give you three days' worth of food.

15:41.065 --> 15:42.865
Don't come closer. Back off!

15:43.385 --> 15:45.065
To them,

15:45.145 --> 15:47.825
you're just meat
that can fill a starving wolf.

15:47.905 --> 15:49.025
They won't let go.

15:50.145 --> 15:51.425
You're kind-hearted,

15:52.225 --> 15:54.145
so will you kill these refugees to escape

15:55.185 --> 15:56.705
or surrender?

16:02.505 --> 16:05.145
Who are you? Ling Jueding's subordinate?

16:07.545 --> 16:09.465
Do you know the punishment
for stealing military grain?

16:14.225 --> 16:16.865
You seem bold and shrewd.
And you fight well.

16:18.425 --> 16:20.425
Why don't you work for me?

16:20.985 --> 16:23.025
Maybe I can persuade
my brother to spare you.

16:25.105 --> 16:26.625
You have quite the temper.

16:27.225 --> 16:29.905
But I'd like to see
if you're still this tough

16:29.985 --> 16:31.225
when you meet my brother.

16:36.465 --> 16:38.585
Winning and losing are part of war.

16:39.545 --> 16:42.865
I just want that darn emperor
to feel miserable.

16:45.105 --> 16:46.265
Here.

16:46.345 --> 16:47.585
A toast to General.

16:53.665 --> 16:54.945
Kumor.

16:55.025 --> 16:56.425
Sand City's grain has been seized.

16:56.505 --> 16:58.585
-What?
-Bring him over.

17:01.065 --> 17:01.905
It's him.

17:02.505 --> 17:04.105
He led the raid to steal the grain.

17:17.505 --> 17:20.944
This guy looks familiar.

17:40.905 --> 17:41.945
I remember now.

17:42.465 --> 17:46.145
You shot an arrow at me
on the day of the siege.

17:51.825 --> 17:53.865
You've got guts.

17:53.945 --> 17:56.025
How dare you steal my rations?

17:57.065 --> 17:59.385
You're about to die,
yet you can still smile?

18:00.705 --> 18:01.985
If one life

18:02.705 --> 18:05.385
can force a general
to run out of supplies,

18:06.225 --> 18:07.785
-it's worth it.
-You…

18:08.705 --> 18:10.305
If you can tell me where the grain is…

18:11.145 --> 18:13.865
I suppose it's
already in Jiangzhou's camp.

18:14.585 --> 18:15.825
Drag him away.

18:15.905 --> 18:17.225
Kill him and use him as
a sacrifice to the war flag.

18:17.945 --> 18:18.785
Yes.

18:53.465 --> 18:55.025
Your Majesty. Are you alright?

18:58.425 --> 18:59.345
I'm fine.

19:00.185 --> 19:02.385
I just had a nightmare.

19:02.465 --> 19:05.545
PURE AND SPOTLESS

19:05.625 --> 19:06.785
Speaking of,

19:06.865 --> 19:08.905
Why is today's battle report
still not here?

19:10.465 --> 19:11.985
I'll urge Commander Li again.

19:44.665 --> 19:46.585
Bring all Great Qi prisoners.

19:47.265 --> 19:48.425
Kill them as sacrifice to the war flag.

19:48.505 --> 19:49.585
Yes!

20:18.665 --> 20:19.625
Wait!

20:25.305 --> 20:26.625
I'm the one who stole your grain.

20:27.145 --> 20:29.425
You should kill me first.

20:30.985 --> 20:32.265
Winners rule, losers fall.

20:32.345 --> 20:34.705
You've fallen into my hands.

20:34.785 --> 20:36.985
What right do you have to negotiate?

20:38.345 --> 20:39.785
One takes responsibility
for what they've done.

20:40.465 --> 20:42.465
This whole grain raid
had nothing to do with them.

20:46.505 --> 20:49.385
I've long heard General Kumor was brave.

20:49.465 --> 20:50.705
Could it be

20:51.305 --> 20:53.625
you're just a coward
who slaughters innocents?

21:01.665 --> 21:03.225
Since you have a death wish,

21:03.785 --> 21:05.465
I'll personally send you on your way.

21:41.785 --> 21:43.305
Good. Again!

22:12.305 --> 22:13.265
Phoenix Seal?

22:14.105 --> 22:15.465
Why would Phoenix Seal be on me?

22:59.425 --> 23:00.785
So you're a woman.

23:11.105 --> 23:13.265
EMPRESS'S SEAL

23:16.985 --> 23:18.465
Keep a close eye on her.

23:21.745 --> 23:22.985
Kumor. What about the sacrifice?

23:23.585 --> 23:24.785
We're not doing it.

23:24.865 --> 23:27.265
I'm keeping this woman.

23:30.025 --> 23:31.385
Then… What about the grain?

23:32.865 --> 23:35.585
With this generous gift
from Emperor of Great Qi,

23:35.665 --> 23:36.985
why would we fear lacking grain?

23:37.585 --> 23:39.665
I fear even this war

23:39.745 --> 23:41.345
may soon come to an end.

23:43.105 --> 23:45.545
What you're holding isn't mine.
Don't overthink it.

23:47.425 --> 23:49.265
-Take her away!
-Yes!

23:59.625 --> 24:01.905
EMPRESS'S SEAL

24:02.585 --> 24:03.425
Your Majesty.

24:05.865 --> 24:08.385
The battle report has arrived.
There's also a letter from Kumor.

24:23.265 --> 24:26.065
YOUR EMPRESS IS IN MY HANDS.

24:26.145 --> 24:29.025
EMPRESS'S SEAL

24:33.105 --> 24:34.985
Your Majesty. What happened?

24:35.065 --> 24:36.385
The Empress's Phoenix Seal.

24:37.745 --> 24:38.905
Your Majesty, rest assured.

24:38.985 --> 24:40.385
If Kumor saw Phoenix Seal,

24:40.465 --> 24:42.145
he would never dare harm Her Majesty.

24:42.985 --> 24:44.385
Kumor thinks

24:44.465 --> 24:47.145
capturing my empress gives him a chance.

24:47.745 --> 24:49.425
I would like to see clearly

24:50.065 --> 24:52.345
whether this is my downfall

24:52.425 --> 24:53.985
or Xijiang's turning point.

25:36.665 --> 25:37.865
Your Majesty.

25:37.945 --> 25:39.145
When the palace gates opened this morning,

25:39.225 --> 25:40.985
Grand Tutor Ling is
already waiting outside the hall.

25:41.065 --> 25:43.305
He said he has urgent matters to discuss.

25:43.865 --> 25:45.505
Should we summon him in?

25:46.585 --> 25:47.545
Prepare to go to Nanrong Palace.

25:47.625 --> 25:49.905
Your Majesty.
You didn't sleep at all last night.

25:49.985 --> 25:51.745
Should you rest for a while first?

25:51.825 --> 25:52.665
No need.

25:53.265 --> 25:54.625
My time is running out.

26:25.905 --> 26:26.945
Preceptor Du.

26:27.905 --> 26:29.145
You're distracted.

26:37.065 --> 26:39.225
Your board is a bit chaotic.

26:40.625 --> 26:41.625
I'm most apprehensive.

26:45.945 --> 26:47.025
It's your move.

27:00.425 --> 27:01.465
I heard

27:02.145 --> 27:02.985
Ling Xuefeng is already

27:03.065 --> 27:04.665
waiting outside
Wuying Hall for Your Majesty this morning.

27:04.745 --> 27:07.145
There must be emergency
military news from Jiangzhou.

27:08.785 --> 27:09.825
Yet Your Majesty

27:10.985 --> 27:12.145
came to play chess with me instead.

27:14.225 --> 27:16.105
Kumor has captured my empress.

27:16.705 --> 27:17.705
The empress?

27:21.345 --> 27:22.865
Her Majesty is the empress.

27:23.465 --> 27:24.545
She fell into enemy hands.

27:25.185 --> 27:26.425
The war situation is unsettled.

27:26.505 --> 27:27.665
One wrong move,

27:28.265 --> 27:29.705
and everything is lost.

27:31.065 --> 27:32.385
What do you think?

27:32.985 --> 27:34.585
How should I play this move?

27:37.785 --> 27:40.105
I'm dull-witted. I dare not speak rashly.

27:42.185 --> 27:44.465
I intend to go to Xijiang myself

27:44.545 --> 27:45.705
and negotiate with Kumor.

27:45.785 --> 27:46.985
What do you think?

27:47.065 --> 27:48.025
No.

27:53.545 --> 27:56.545
This empire's fate
rests entirely on Your Majesty.

27:57.745 --> 27:59.305
You must not leave
the palace at such a time.

28:00.545 --> 28:01.425
Going alone into danger

28:02.905 --> 28:04.465
will cause unthinkable consequences.

28:05.865 --> 28:09.225
In your opinion, who would be suitable?

28:10.345 --> 28:11.945
If Your Majesty wishes for peace talks

28:12.025 --> 28:13.105
to save Jiangzhou,

28:14.705 --> 28:19.825
the envoy
must hold status and authority in court.

28:21.465 --> 28:24.065
Grand Tutor Ling has
been waiting outside the hall,

28:24.825 --> 28:26.385
and Xiao Qianqing is in the Capital.

28:27.465 --> 28:29.745
If Grand Tutor Ling goes,

28:29.825 --> 28:32.025
whether it's out of
concern for his daughter

28:32.105 --> 28:34.025
or to protect
Ling Jueding's command in Jiangzhou,

28:35.185 --> 28:38.305
it would harm the interests of Great Qi.

28:40.745 --> 28:42.705
Xiao Qianqing is ambitious and ruthless.

28:43.425 --> 28:44.665
If he colludes with Kumor

28:46.025 --> 28:49.025
and Jiangzhou falls,
Your Majesty's life would be in danger.

28:59.705 --> 29:02.505
I, Du Tingxin, am willing to
serve as the imperial envoy to Xijiang

29:03.185 --> 29:04.825
to go on Your Majesty's
behalf to the rebel's camp

29:04.905 --> 29:06.425
and negotiate with Kumor.

29:09.225 --> 29:12.705
You're righteous
to resolve the crisis for me.

29:14.545 --> 29:16.265
Before you depart,

29:16.865 --> 29:18.745
I wish to request something.

29:26.625 --> 29:29.145
Everything I have
was given by Your Majesty.

29:30.625 --> 29:31.625
Whatever you desire,

29:32.465 --> 29:34.905
I will give
whatever I have without hesitation.

29:38.985 --> 29:40.225
Yushu Pill.

29:40.305 --> 29:41.385
Yushu Pill?

29:44.985 --> 29:46.545
Yushu Pill is potent.

29:46.625 --> 29:47.785
While it can forcibly
suppress cold poison,

29:47.865 --> 29:49.625
it's only temporary.

29:49.705 --> 29:51.465
-It may even accelerate…
-I know

29:52.345 --> 29:53.785
it could hasten my death.

29:55.825 --> 29:57.905
But Great Qi is facing
internal and external crises.

29:58.425 --> 30:00.305
I must endure this period.

30:00.385 --> 30:01.665
I cannot afford any mistakes.

30:02.385 --> 30:05.105
If my body suffers any mishap,

30:05.185 --> 30:07.345
do you think
Ling Xuefeng and Xiao Qianqing

30:07.425 --> 30:08.625
will spare me?

30:11.025 --> 30:13.025
Since you know,

30:14.185 --> 30:15.305
why

30:16.385 --> 30:18.985
give the life-saving
medicine to Her Majesty?

30:25.825 --> 30:26.665
Preceptor Du.

30:27.385 --> 30:28.785
You've overstepped.

30:38.065 --> 30:38.905
Rise.

30:39.745 --> 30:42.505
I know you've always been loyal to me.

30:44.505 --> 30:45.345
In that case,

30:46.945 --> 30:48.265
give me Yushu Pill.

31:49.305 --> 31:51.465
During this period,
you must not use inner force.

31:52.345 --> 31:53.905
I will do my utmost

31:53.985 --> 31:55.625
to find a cure for you.

31:57.865 --> 31:59.025
If the poison reaches the heart,

32:01.265 --> 32:03.065
I fear even I can't do anything.

32:03.145 --> 32:04.185
Very well.

32:07.465 --> 32:08.345
Your Majesty.

32:10.465 --> 32:11.305
I'm fine.

32:12.345 --> 32:13.705
You need not worry.

32:14.625 --> 32:15.465
This time,

32:16.105 --> 32:17.665
your mission to Xijiang

32:18.545 --> 32:19.705
must succeed.

32:37.905 --> 32:39.425
How long has Grand Tutor been waiting?

32:40.345 --> 32:43.065
Your Majesty.
It has already been three hours.

32:44.105 --> 32:45.065
Very well.

32:45.625 --> 32:46.945
Let him continue to wait.

33:15.345 --> 33:16.625
Shi Yan.

33:16.705 --> 33:18.265
Take Xiaoxing Guards to Xijiang

33:18.345 --> 33:20.505
and find a way
to investigate Kumor's camp.

33:21.105 --> 33:22.625
Search for any trace of the Empress.

33:22.705 --> 33:24.945
Leave no clue unexamined.

33:25.905 --> 33:26.745
Yes.

33:28.665 --> 33:29.825
WUYING HALL

33:29.905 --> 33:32.825
You're in such a hurry to see me.
What's the matter?

33:33.425 --> 33:34.345
Your Majesty.

33:35.225 --> 33:37.945
Her Majesty has been
recuperating at the outer palace for days.

33:38.025 --> 33:40.865
I'm very concerned and wish to visit her.

33:40.945 --> 33:43.505
I hope you will grant permission.

33:44.105 --> 33:46.745
The Empress's
condition has worsened recently,

33:46.825 --> 33:47.945
making it inconvenient for visitors.

33:48.025 --> 33:50.345
Is it inconvenient or impossible?

33:55.345 --> 33:56.745
Why do you say so?

33:58.025 --> 33:59.225
Have you heard some rumor?

34:00.745 --> 34:02.585
Since Your Majesty

34:02.665 --> 34:04.625
does not wish to discuss the Empress,

34:04.705 --> 34:05.745
I won't press the matter.

34:06.385 --> 34:08.425
I suddenly remembered

34:08.505 --> 34:10.425
when Your Majesty suddenly fell ill

34:11.625 --> 34:12.824
before ascending the throne,

34:13.744 --> 34:16.105
and the Empress Dowager
urgently summoned me to the palace.

34:17.344 --> 34:18.665
I know this,

34:19.344 --> 34:21.304
but the Empress Dowager
had already concluded

34:21.385 --> 34:22.225
that I was incapable

34:23.185 --> 34:24.665
and tried to recruit you

34:24.744 --> 34:25.824
to depose me

34:26.344 --> 34:27.744
and make Xiao Qianqing emperor.

34:29.505 --> 34:32.105
These old events are not worth mentioning.

34:32.185 --> 34:34.025
What I wish to tell you

34:34.665 --> 34:36.065
is something

34:36.945 --> 34:38.625
unknown to you.

34:40.905 --> 34:42.824
Somehow,

34:43.425 --> 34:45.784
Cangcang hid in my sedan chair

34:45.865 --> 34:46.985
and entered the palace with me.

34:48.505 --> 34:50.545
By some twist of fate,

34:50.625 --> 34:52.824
she sneaked into
Your Majesty's bedchamber.

35:13.665 --> 35:15.505
You're the emperor
ascending the throne tomorrow?

35:28.865 --> 35:29.945
How hot.

35:31.105 --> 35:33.345
Cold. It's cold.

35:41.025 --> 35:42.225
Is this better?

35:43.465 --> 35:44.985
Do you feel better?

35:47.865 --> 35:51.545
-Am I going to die?
-You won't die.

35:51.625 --> 35:54.305
Have you forgotten?
You're ascending the throne tomorrow.

35:56.345 --> 35:57.425
Really?

35:58.185 --> 35:59.945
Can I really ascend the throne?

36:00.025 --> 36:00.865
Of course.

36:00.945 --> 36:03.025
You're the chosen one,

36:03.105 --> 36:05.385
destined to be the emperor of Great Qi.

36:05.465 --> 36:07.865
With a sweeping gesture of your sleeves,

36:07.945 --> 36:09.225
you rule the world

36:09.905 --> 36:11.625
and command respect from all sides.

36:15.825 --> 36:17.705
Rule the world

36:18.305 --> 36:19.945
and command respect from all sides.

36:40.505 --> 36:44.425
Later, I finally found Cangcang.

36:45.065 --> 36:47.025
On the way home,

36:47.625 --> 36:48.825
she told me

36:51.425 --> 36:53.545
you're the chosen one.

36:54.185 --> 36:56.385
I had been hesitating.

36:56.465 --> 36:57.785
Upon hearing this,

36:58.385 --> 37:00.225
I suddenly

37:00.305 --> 37:03.505
became determined
and believed that the two of you

37:03.585 --> 37:05.745
are a match made in heaven.

37:07.545 --> 37:08.985
I never expected

37:09.065 --> 37:10.985
you share such
a deep bond with your daughter.

37:12.185 --> 37:14.025
Even your decision to support me

37:14.105 --> 37:16.825
was because of a playful
remark the Empress made in her youth.

37:18.105 --> 37:20.145
If the Empress hadn't been poisoned,

37:20.225 --> 37:21.425
and the poison

37:22.105 --> 37:25.545
wasn't coincidentally
in the pear blossom honey you sent,

37:25.625 --> 37:27.385
I would have almost…

37:27.985 --> 37:32.265
almost been moved by your fatherly love.

37:33.625 --> 37:34.625
Your Majesty.

37:35.185 --> 37:37.625
Why such suspicion?

37:38.945 --> 37:39.945
Grand Tutor.

37:41.065 --> 37:42.745
I'm your student.

37:43.505 --> 37:44.785
You need not pretend

37:45.625 --> 37:47.545
in front of me.

37:49.225 --> 37:50.865
I no longer want to guess

37:50.945 --> 37:54.505
how much of your love for you daughter

37:54.585 --> 37:55.745
is genuine

37:56.425 --> 37:57.665
and how much is mixed with ambition.

37:58.265 --> 38:01.385
But I know you value

38:02.025 --> 38:04.465
command of the Jiangzhou army
more than the Empress's life.

38:06.225 --> 38:08.185
Ling Jueding is
straightforward and forthright.

38:08.265 --> 38:11.465
If he knew his sister
was trapped in enemy territory,

38:11.545 --> 38:13.425
he might risk everything
and lead troops to save her.

38:14.385 --> 38:16.985
The ministers at court
are all keeping an eye on Jiangzhou's war.

38:17.065 --> 38:19.265
If he makes even a single mistake,

38:19.825 --> 38:22.345
he could lose his position as general.

38:22.945 --> 38:24.945
Do you

38:26.185 --> 38:29.265
have no genuine
feeling for Her Majesty at all?

38:32.025 --> 38:33.025
I plan

38:33.705 --> 38:35.465
to send word to Kumor

38:36.465 --> 38:37.505
that Phoenix Seal has been stolen.

38:39.065 --> 38:40.945
Do you think Kumor will believe it?

38:41.625 --> 38:43.345
As long as everyone else does,

38:43.425 --> 38:44.745
it doesn't matter if he believes it.

38:45.265 --> 38:46.185
I want him to know

38:47.505 --> 38:48.665
he can't threaten me.

38:53.825 --> 38:57.305
Without her status as the Empress,

38:58.345 --> 39:00.785
Kumor would kill her without hesitation.

39:00.865 --> 39:02.345
If he kills Cangcang,

39:04.105 --> 39:05.985
Jueding will surely slaughter Xijiang.

39:06.905 --> 39:09.785
If he wins,
you can avert the crisis in Xijiang.

39:09.865 --> 39:11.145
If he loses,

39:12.625 --> 39:16.225
you can reclaim
command of the Jiangzhou army.

39:21.065 --> 39:22.785
If you dislike this,

39:23.345 --> 39:24.305
I have another plan.

39:26.385 --> 39:29.705
I will personally go to Xijiang,

39:29.785 --> 39:32.505
negotiate with Kumor,
and bring the Empress back.

39:33.385 --> 39:34.305
Your Majesty.

39:35.185 --> 39:36.185
What do you want?

39:37.065 --> 39:38.465
During my absence from the Capital,

39:39.225 --> 39:41.985
I want Prince of Yuzhang,
Xiao Qianqing, to act as regent.

39:59.025 --> 40:00.505
Your Majesty is wise.

40:01.105 --> 40:05.385
I will fully support
Prince of Yuzhang as regent.

40:17.185 --> 40:18.265
You just heard, right?

40:18.825 --> 40:20.145
The Empress has been captured.

40:20.225 --> 40:21.865
I will personally rescue her.

40:22.425 --> 40:24.585
During this period,
you will act as regent.

40:25.665 --> 40:27.385
You worry Grand Tutor Ling

40:27.465 --> 40:30.345
will seize control of
the court after leaving the Capital?

40:30.865 --> 40:32.745
Now that Her Majesty has been captured,

40:32.825 --> 40:34.425
you act accordingly,

40:34.505 --> 40:36.865
forcing Grand Tutor Ling
to support my regency.

40:37.465 --> 40:40.585
I'm determined to get
the command of the Jiangzhou army.

40:46.105 --> 40:46.945
What if I refuse?

40:49.305 --> 40:50.345
Why refuse?

40:50.945 --> 40:52.745
I'm afraid of being plotted against

40:52.825 --> 40:54.545
and not know how I end up dying.

40:55.425 --> 40:56.785
If I tell you

40:57.425 --> 41:00.105
everything I do is for Cangcang,

41:00.825 --> 41:01.665
would you believe me?

41:02.385 --> 41:03.225
No.

41:03.985 --> 41:06.265
The Jiangzhou war is unpredictable.

41:06.345 --> 41:07.265
Your imperial power is unstable,

41:07.985 --> 41:10.145
so you will personally go to Jiangzhou,

41:10.225 --> 41:12.745
defeat Kumor,
and reclaim the army's command.

41:13.665 --> 41:15.145
Every step of your plan

41:15.825 --> 41:17.185
is for your imperial power.

41:20.305 --> 41:21.265
Yes.

41:22.225 --> 41:25.225
My throne was hard-won,
so I must protect it.

41:26.585 --> 41:27.425
But this time,

41:28.105 --> 41:30.625
you're closer to my throne than ever.

41:31.185 --> 41:32.265
If I were you,

41:32.865 --> 41:34.945
I would cherish this opportunity.

41:41.865 --> 41:44.225
Alright. I…

41:49.585 --> 41:51.665
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

41:53.265 --> 41:55.425
-Prince of Yuzhang, receive the decree.
-I am ready.

41:55.505 --> 41:58.745
I am ill
and needs rest in the secondary palace.

41:59.465 --> 42:00.665
During this time,

42:00.745 --> 42:03.545
Prince of Yuzhang,
Xiao Qianqing, will act as regent.

42:04.305 --> 42:07.145
I, Xiao Qianqing,
accept the decree with gratitude.

42:11.745 --> 42:12.665
Rise.

42:20.465 --> 42:23.705
You may open this pouch

42:23.785 --> 42:24.705
when the time is right.

42:30.265 --> 42:31.145
When is the time right?

42:32.105 --> 42:33.425
You'll know when the moment comes.

42:38.345 --> 42:39.185
I shall take my leave.

42:48.865 --> 42:49.705
Your Majesty.

42:50.665 --> 42:52.705
Are you really giving
the regency to Prince of Yuzhang?

42:53.345 --> 42:54.625
What if he and Empress Dowager Liu…

42:55.225 --> 42:57.985
My brother is remarkably intelligent.

42:58.945 --> 43:02.705
He knows
the fiercer he clashes with Grand Tutor,

43:02.785 --> 43:04.025
the easier it is for me to benefit.

43:05.305 --> 43:06.305
But he also knows

43:06.385 --> 43:08.865
I placed him in this position

43:08.945 --> 43:10.185
so that he can't avoid conflict.

43:11.025 --> 43:13.185
Any mistake

43:13.265 --> 43:16.785
could make him
completely devoured by the opponent,

43:17.385 --> 43:19.945
but I chose him for another reason.

43:20.625 --> 43:21.625
What is that?

43:22.305 --> 43:23.225
I trust

43:23.945 --> 43:26.265
this brother still has a conscience.

43:26.345 --> 43:29.425
He would never
ignore the people of Xuzhou.
